# Photo Editor by MatsSjodin.com — environment variables
#
# This app requires NO environment variables to run. It is fully client-side:
# no backend, database, secrets, or third-party API keys.
#
# Optional: privacy-friendly, cookieless analytics (Plausible). When set, the
# Plausible script is injected and page views are counted for this domain. Leave
# unset to collect nothing (the default).
#   VITE_PLAUSIBLE_DOMAIN=photoeditor.matssjodin.com
#
# This file is a placeholder/contract for future contributors. If you add server
# logic:
#   - Server-only secrets: read inside a handler or a *.server.ts module
#     (never at module top level on Cloudflare Workers — env binds per request).
#     Example:  DATABASE_URL=...
#   - Public, client-readable values MUST be prefixed with VITE_ and contain no
#     secrets (they ship to the browser).
#     Example:  VITE_ANALYTICS_ID=...
#
# Copy this file to `.env` (gitignored) when you introduce real variables.
